.TH POHODA-FAKE-BANK 1 "" "0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pohoda\-fake\-bank \- create a fake Pohoda bank receipt via mServer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pohoda-fake-bank
[\fB\-\-amount=\fR\fIAMOUNT\fR]
[\fB\-\-account=\fR\fIIDS\fR]
[\fB\-\-sym-var=\fR\fIVARIABLE\fR]
[\fB\-\-text=\fR\fITEXT\fR]
[\fB\-\-bank-type=\fR\fIreceipt|expense\fR]
[\fB\-\-json\fR]
[\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inserts one synthetic bank document into Stormware Pohoda through mServer.
Intended for exercising changes-API pollers and related integrations.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-amount=\fIAMOUNT\fR
Receipt amount (default from environment or a random value).
.TP
.B \-\-account=\fIIDS\fR
Pohoda bank account ids (default from \fBPOHODA_BANK_ACCOUNT\fR, often KB).
.TP
.B \-\-sym-var=\fIVARIABLE\fR
Variable symbol (default: current unix timestamp).
.TP
.B \-\-text=\fITEXT\fR
Payment text / description.
.TP
.B \-\-bank-type=\fIreceipt|expense\fR
Bank document type (default: receipt).
.TP
.B \-\-json
Print the result as JSON.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show usage and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B POHODA_URL
mServer base URL.
.TP
.B POHODA_ICO
Accounting unit IČO.
.TP
.B POHODA_USERNAME
mServer username.
.TP
.B POHODA_PASSWORD
mServer password.
.TP
.B POHODA_BANK_ACCOUNT
Default bank account ids.
.SH AUTHOR
Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>
